          "type": "text",
          "text": "{\"snapshotId\":\"capture-32df8921-3d29-4b1c-b748-2147714e92d2\",\"url\":\"https://nodejs.org/en/blog/release/v24.0.0\",\"title\":\"Node.js — Node.js 24.0.0 (Current)\",\"text\":\"Node.js 24.0.0 (Current)\\nRG\\n\\nRafael Gonzaga\\n\\nNode.js 24.0.0 (Current)\\n2025-05-06, Version 24.0.0 (Current), @RafaelGSS and @juanarbol\\n\\nWe’re excited to announce the release of Node.js 24! This release brings several significant updates, including the upgrade of the V8 JavaScript engine to version 13.6 and npm to version 11. Starting with Node.js 24, support for MSVC has been removed, and ClangCL is now required to compile Node.js on Windows. The AsyncLocalStorage API now uses AsyncContextFrame by default, and URLPattern is available globally. These changes, along with many other improvements, continue to push the platform forward.\\n\\nAs a reminder, Node.js 24 will enter long-term support (LTS) in October, but until then, it will be the \\\"Current\\\" release for the next six months. We encourage you to explore the new features and benefits offered by this latest release and evaluate their potential impact on your applications.\\n\\nNotable Changes\\nV8 13.6\\n\\nThe V8 engine is updated to version 13.6, which includes several new JavaScript features:\\n\\nFloat16Array\\nExplicit resource management\\nRegExp.escape\\nWebAssembly Memory64\\nError.isError\\n\\nThe V8 update was a contribution by Michaël Zasso in #58070.\\n\\nnpm 11\\n\\nNode.js 24 comes with npm 11, which includes several improvements and new features. This update brings enhanced performance, improved security features, and better compatibility with modern JavaScript packages.\\n\\nThe npm update was a contribution by the npm team in #56274.\\n\\nAsyncLocalStorage defaults to AsyncContextFrame\\n\\nAsyncLocalStorage now uses AsyncContextFrame by default, which provides a more efficient implementation of asynchronous context tracking. This change improves performance and makes the API more robust for advanced use cases.\\n\\nThis change was a contribution by Stephen Belanger in #55552.\\n\\nURLPattern as a global\\n\\nThe URLPattern API is now exposed on the global object, making it easier to use without explicit imports. This API provides a powerful pattern matching system for URLs, similar to how regular expressions work for strings.\\n\\nThis feature was a contribution by Jonas Badalič in #56950.\\n\\nPermission Model Improvements\\n\\nThe experimental Permission Model introduced in Node.js 20 has been improved, and the flag has been changed from --experimental-permission to simply --permission, indicating its increasing stability and readiness for broader adoption.\\n\\nThis change was a contribution by Rafael Gonzaga in #56240.\\n\\nTest Runner Enhancements\\n\\nThe test runner module now automatically waits for subtests to finish, eliminating the need to manually await test promises. This makes writing tests more intuitive and reduces common errors related to unhandled promises.\\n\\nThe test runner improvements were contributions by Colin Ihrig in #56664.\\n\\nUndici 7\\n\\nNode.js 24 includes Undici 7, which brings numerous improvements to the HTTP client capabilities, including better performance and support for newer HTTP features.\\n\\nDeprecations and Removals\\n\\nSeveral APIs have been deprecated or removed in this release:\",\"links\":[{\"url\":\"https://github.com/RafaelGSS\",\"label\":\"RG\"},{\"url\":\"https://nodejs.org/en/blog/release/v24.0.0\",\"label\":\"2025-05-06, Version 24.0.0 (Current), @RafaelGSS and @juanarbol\"},{\"url\":\"https://chromestatus.com/feature/5164400693215232\",\"label\":\"Float16Array\"},{\"url\":\"https://tc39.es/proposal-explicit-resource-management/\",\"label\":\"Explicit resource management\"},{\"url\":\"https://github.com/tc39/proposal-regex-escaping\",\"label\":\"RegExp.escape\"},{\"url\":\"https://github.com/WebAssembly/memory64\",\"label\":\"WebAssembly Memory64\"},{\"url\":\"https://github.com/tc39/proposal-is-error\",\"label\":\"Error.isError\"},{\"url\":\"https://github.com/nodejs/node/pull/58070\",\"label\":\"#58070\"},{\"url\":\"https://github.com/nodejs/node/pull/56274\",\"label\":\"#56274\"},{\"url\":\"https://github.com/nodejs/node/pull/55552\",\"label\":\"#55552\"},{\"url\":\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/URLPattern\",\"label\":\"URLPattern\"},{\"url\":\"https://github.com/nodejs/node/pull/56950\",\"label\":\"#56950\"},{\"url\":\"https://github.com/nodejs/node/pull/56240\",\"label\":\"#56240\"},{\"url\":\"https://github.com/nodejs/node/pull/56664\",\"label\":\"#56664\"},{\"url\":\"https://github.com/nodejs/node/pull/55017\",\"label\":\"#55017\"},{\"url\":\"https://github.com/nodejs/node/pull/57361\",\"label\":\"#57361\"},{\"url\":\"https://github.com/nodejs/node/pull/55175\",\"label\":\"#55175\"},{\"url\":\"https://github.com/nodejs/node/pull/54869\",\"label\":\"#54869\"},{\"url\":\"https://github.com/nodejs/node/pull/55718\",\"label\":\"#55718\"},{\"url\":\"https://github.com/nodejs/node/pull/57199\",\"label\":\"#57199\"},{\"url\":\"https://github.com/nodejs/node/commit/c6b934380a\",\"label\":\"c6b934380a\"},{\"url\":\"https://github.com/nodejs/node/pull/58154\",\"label\":\"#58154\"},{\"url\":\"https://github.com/nodejs/node/commit/69efb81a73\",\"label\":\"69efb81a73\"},{\"url\":\"https://github.com/nodejs/node/commit/b00ff4270e\",\"label\":\"b00ff4270e\"},{\"url\":\"https://github.com/nodejs/node/commit/b81697d860\",\"label\":\"b81697d860\"},{\"url\":\"https://github.com/nodejs/node/commit/1f06169b87\",\"label\":\"1f06169b87\"},{\"url\":\"https://github.com/nodejs/node/commit/eae9a296f0\",\"label\":\"eae9a296f0\"},{\"url\":\"https://github.com/nodejs/node/commit/087c254a11\",\"label\":\"087c254a11\"},{\"url\":\"https://github.com/nodejs/node/commit/9e49bedd8e\",\"label\":\"9e49bedd8e\"},{\"url\":\"https://github.com/nodejs/node/commit/93cca8a43e\",\"label\":\"93cca8a43e\"},{\"url\":\"https://github.com/nodejs/node/commit/347daa07be\",\"label\":\"347daa07be\"},{\"url\":\"https://github.com/nodejs/node/commit/2a35d5a86c\",\"label\":\"2a35d5a86c\"},{\"url\":\"https://github.com/nodejs/node/commit/b0fb5a09cf\",\"label\":\"b0fb5a09cf\"},{\"url\":\"https://github.com/nodejs/node/commit/dd4c5d6c73\",\"label\":\"dd4c5d6c73\"},{\"url\":\"https://github.com/nodejs/node/commit/1d5d7b6eed\",\"label\":\"1d5d7b6eed\"},{\"url\":\"https://github.com/nodejs/node/commit/3779e43cce\",\"label\":\"3779e43cce\"},{\"url\":\"https://github.com/nodejs/node/commit/82c2255206\",\"label\":\"82c2255206\"},{\"url\":\"https://github.com/nodejs/node/commit/8a258eb7b1\",\"label\":\"8a258eb7b1\"},{\"url\":\"https://github.com/nodejs/node/commit/9e0d9b6024\",\"label\":\"9e0d9b6024\"},{\"url\":\"https://github.com/nodejs/node/commit/f7406aa56d\",\"label\":\"f7406aa56d\"},{\"url\":\"https://github.com/nodejs/node/commit/c7493fac5e\",\"label\":\"c7493fac5e\"},{\"url\":\"https://github.com/nodejs/node/commit/50a8527867\",\"label\":\"50a8527867\"},{\"url\":\"https://github.com/nodejs/node/commit/9c1ebb713c\",\"label\":\"9c1ebb713c\"},{\"url\":\"https://github.com/nodejs/node/commit/fb3d5ea45d\",\"label\":\"fb3d5ea45d\"},{\"url\":\"https://github.com/nodejs/node/commit/756abacf73\",\"label\":\"756abacf73\"},{\"url\":\"https://github.com/nodejs/node/commit/f8953e54b0\",\"label\":\"f8953e54b0\"},{\"url\":\"https://github.com/nodejs/node/commit/c8a0e205e1\",\"label\":\"c8a0e205e1\"},{\"url\":\"https://github.com/nodejs/node/commit/1689ee84ce\",\"label\":\"1689ee84ce\"},{\"url\":\"https://github.com/nodejs/node/commit/15f2fb9467\",\"label\":\"15f2fb9467\"},{\"url\":\"https://github.com/nodejs/node/commit/4ab254c9f2\",\"label\":\"4ab254c9f2\"}],\"outline\":\"Node.js 24.0.0 (Current)\\n2025-05-06, Version 24.0.0 (Current), @RafaelGSS and @juanarbol\\nNotable Changes\\nV8 13.6\\nnpm 11\\nAsyncLocalStorage defaults to AsyncContextFrame\\nURLPattern as a global\\nPermission Model Improvements\\nTest Runner Enhancements\\nUndici 7\\nDeprecations and Removals\\nSemver-Major Commits\\nSemver-Minor Commits\\nSemver-Patch Commits\\nSHASUMS\",\"segmentIndex\":0,\"segmentCount\":5,\"truncated\":true,\"captureTruncated\":false,\"httpStatus\":200}"
        }
