      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "{\"snapshotId\":\"capture-2e92b72d-44a1-428a-ae22-0ea27119976e\",\"url\":\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/nodejs/node/v24.0.0/doc/api/deprecations.md\",\"title\":\"\",\"text\":\"on: Documentation-only deprecation.\\n-->\\n\\nType: Runtime\\n\\nInstantiating classes without the `new` qualifier exported by the `node:repl` module is deprecated.\\nIt is recommended to use the `new` qualifier instead. This applies to all REPL classes, including\\n`REPLServer` and `Recoverable`.\\n\\n<!-- md-lint skip-deprecation DEP0186 -->\\n\\n### DEP0187: Passing invalid argument types to `fs.existsSync`\\n\\n<!-- YAML\\nchanges:\\n  - version: v24.0.0\\n    pr-url: https://github.com/nodejs/node/pull/55753\\n    description: Runtime deprecation.\\n  - version:\\n    - v23.4.0\\n    - v22.13.0\\n    pr-url: https://github.com/nodejs/node/pull/55892\\n    description: Documentation-only.\\n-->\\n\\nType: Runtime\\n\\nPassing non-supported argument types is deprecated and, instead of returning `false`,\\nwill throw an error in a future version.\\n\\n### DEP0188: `process.features.ipv6` and `process.features.uv`\\n\\n<!-- YAML\\nchanges:\\n  - version:\\n    - v23.4.0\\n    - v22.13.0\\n    pr-url: https://github.com/nodejs/node/pull/55545\\n    description: Documentation-only deprecation.\\n-->\\n\\nType: Documentation-only\\n\\nThese properties are unconditionally `true`. Any checks based on these properties are redundant.\\n\\n### DEP0189: `process.features.tls_*`\\n\\n<!-- YAML\\nchanges:\\n  - version:\\n    - v23.4.0\\n    - v22.13.0\\n    pr-url: https://github.com/nodejs/node/pull/55545\\n    description: Documentation-only deprecation.\\n-->\\n\\nType: Documentation-only\\n\\n`process.features.tls_alpn`, `process.features.tls_ocsp`, and `process.features.tls_sni` are\\ndeprecated, as their values are guaranteed to be identical to that of `process.features.tls`.\\n\\n### DEP0190: Passing `args` to `node:child_process` `execFile`/`spawn` with `shell` option `